{
  "type": "linear",
  "data": {
    "paras": [
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "手足无措的矿工",
            "content": "不要过来！你一过来，完美的平衡会被打破的！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_006_agminec",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "抱歉！可是......完美的平衡是指这个被倒下的柱子压在地上的雷达吗？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_scared",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "手足无措的矿工",
            "content": "你看，这柱子也不知道是哪一年倒的，倒得这么好，恰好砸在这钻孔雷达不常用的功能模块上。再多一分，我们需要的功能也没法用了。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_006_agminec",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "欸......太阳谷工业的东西好结实，都砸成这样了，还在运作吗......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_shocked",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "手足无措的矿工",
            "content": "可是！这几天采矿平台移动过了，这根柱子的重心就变得不稳定了！只要再歪一点点，这机器就完了，以后都别想掘矿了！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_006_agminec",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "......是错觉吗，柱子好像在摇摇晃晃的。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_confused",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "手足无措的矿工",
            "content": "所以啊啊啊啊甲板上的人别再走了，也别出声了！任何振动都会破坏平衡啊！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_006_agminec",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "请让我试试看。只要小心地把柱子移开，不碰到任何设备就好了，对吗？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_serious",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "手足无措的矿工",
            "content": "可是柱子那——么重又那——么大，我们几个力气大的矿工都不敢动啊，万一、万一......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_006_agminec",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "没时间了，请回答我的问题！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_angry",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "手足无措的矿工",
            "content": "......对！移开的时候不能碰到任何东西......可是你要怎么......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_006_agminec",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "curtain",
          "data": {
            "color": "#000000",
            "delay": 0,
            "inDuration": 0.5,
            "inEase": "InSine",
            "stayDuration": 0,
            "outDuration": 0,
            "outEase": "Unset"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unitDeclarations": [],
    "blackoutOnFinish": true
  }
